# Build artifacts makepkg leaves in the package directory.
#
# These must never be committed: the AUR rejects any blob over 488 KiB, and
# the source tarballs fetched by `makepkg --verifysource` land right here,
# next to PKGBUILD. A `git add -A` after a verify run picks up several MB of
# them and the push is refused server-side.
*.tar.gz
*.tar.xz
*.tar.zst
*.pkg.tar.*
/src/
/pkg/
